# GDHelper Extension — AI Agent Rules

> Read `RULES.md` and `AGENT.md` in the project root for the full design system, component standards, and development guidelines before making any changes.

## Quick Reference

### Design: White + Green (GreenData theme)
- Page background: `bg-[#f0f4f0]`
- Cards: `bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm`
- Accent: `#22c55e` (emerald-500)
- NEVER use dark backgrounds (`bg-slate-*`, `bg-gray-800+`, `bg-zinc-*`)
- NEVER use `rounded-2xl` or `rounded-3xl` for cards — ONLY `rounded-xl`

### Component Reuse (MANDATORY)
- Text buttons → `<Button>` from `src/components/ui/Button.tsx`
- Icon buttons → CSS class `.icon-btn` (+ `.icon-btn--danger`)
- Badges → `<Badge>` from `src/components/ui/Badge.tsx`
- Text inputs → `<Input>` from `src/components/ui/Input.tsx`
- Modals → `<Modal>` from `src/components/ui/Modal.tsx`

### Spacing & Layout
- Gap between card sections: `space-y-3`
- Card padding: `p-3`
- Toolbar padding: `p-1.5`
- Row items: `p-2.5 bg-gray-50/70 hover:bg-emerald-50/30 border border-gray-200 hover:border-emerald-300 rounded-xl`

### Icons
- Components: `lucide-react`
- Navigation/Header: `@vkontakte/icons`
- All icon buttons MUST animate on hover (`.icon-btn` handles this)

### Types
- All interfaces in `src/types/index.ts` — never duplicate
- Use `React.FC<Props>`, no `any`

### Language
- UI text: Russian
- Code identifiers: English
- Commits: English (`type: description`)

### Before commit
- Run `npm run build` (must pass with no errors)
- Windows PowerShell: use `;` not `&&` to chain commands
